{"2354400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VR Drums Ultimate Streamer", "steam_appid": 2354400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2354720, 2373191], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Practice Anytime</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic virtual reality drum set builder and simulator with thousands of dollars of real simulator drum hardware. Practice and play at your own pace, freestyle or cover your favorite song, just like a real drum set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Note Highways</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included in-game both 2D / 3D style note highways with scoring, combos and accuracy readings. Supports .mid, .chart and even raw audio midi files. Also the advanced 32 lane midi audio player note highway that will auto chart the drums in your new and old midi audio files so you can play along to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Connectivity</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the VR drum set to control Clone Hero, YARG, Fortnite Festival, REAPER DAW and more. MIDI Router included in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included 2D note highway example.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/6296446ff5884f52ef25212ba6ef4da1.poster.avif?t=1786722564\" width=578 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/6296446ff5884f52ef25212ba6ef4da1.webm?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/6296446ff5884f52ef25212ba6ef4da1.mp4?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included 3D note highway example.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/016620b4e91f630b7e988f82c0782263.poster.avif?t=1786722564\" width=580 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/016620b4e91f630b7e988f82c0782263.webm?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/016620b4e91f630b7e988f82c0782263.mp4?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controlling Clone Hero desktop application example.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/494fe642432f2d26021e33eced9b3bba.poster.avif?t=1786722564\" width=580 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/494fe642432f2d26021e33eced9b3bba.webm?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/494fe642432f2d26021e33eced9b3bba.mp4?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controlling YARG (Yet Anther Rhythm Game) desktop application example.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/8646a262afe96284505a42fca9cb0dc5.poster.avif?t=1786722564\" width=578 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/8646a262afe96284505a42fca9cb0dc5.webm?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/8646a262afe96284505a42fca9cb0dc5.mp4?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REAPER DAW (Digital Audio Workstation) example.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/ce2d44d9218ae57692497c0dbdd72f4d.poster.avif?t=1786722564\" width=580 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/ce2d44d9218ae57692497c0dbdd72f4d.webm?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/ce2d44d9218ae57692497c0dbdd72f4d.mp4?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIV support for using your own custom VR avatar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/2402854f2d213df8ee8e8e957738c877.poster.avif?t=1786722564\" width=580 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/2402854f2d213df8ee8e8e957738c877.webm?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/2402854f2d213df8ee8e8e957738c877.mp4?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure sensitive hits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drum Racks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Video Recording: Record video in-game with the included LCK tablet or use OBS Studio.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy Saving: Auto save to a single drum kit file, backup or share the save file.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reskin the entire kit, create your own graphic kits with the image template pack or in-game options.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited instrument spawning, drag 'n drop items or choose a already made prebuilt drum kit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC controllers, keyboard and mouse, XBOX, PlayStation, arcade sticks, many hardware devices will work in-game as foot pedals. See the website for more help using Steams re-mapper. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn standard drums, cymbals and more,  electronic kit drum pads.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIV support for use with your own VR avatars or custom VR setups.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioned drum kit comes already setup. Modify it to your liking or clear it and start from scratch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game audio and video players. Play your own music or video's, drum tab lessons, anything you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIDI output. Send notes to programs like REAPER DAW, Fornite Festival, Clone Hero, YARG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game kick/bass pedals.   <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/dd817ebb46f8d1d09c59d90ee077f3b6.poster.avif?t=1786722564\" width=598 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/dd817ebb46f8d1d09c59d90ee077f3b6.webm?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/dd817ebb46f8d1d09c59d90ee077f3b6.mp4?t=1786722564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of dollars in real simulator hardware. Add drums, cymbals, cowbells, splashes, china. Position them where you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear most drummers want and more. 15+ snare drums, 8+ bass drums, crash cymbals, ride cymbals, splash cymbals, tom drums with multiple tom drum heads for different sounds. Tube toms, chimes,  hi-hats, china cymbals, china stacks, mounted tambourine, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the position and settings of everything on your kit and scene, load it back-in next time you play.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 90 drumming sounds and pitch effects to make more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller haptic force feedback. (Option to enable)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attention gone into creating realistic looking drums, cymbals, textures and realistic finishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the freestyle drumming with the 3D or 2D highway. A great way to learn timing and basic rhythm (raw .mid files or Clone Hero song folders, example Moonscraper Chart Editor, Feedback Chart Editor, Reaper DAW etc.) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic instrumental sounds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search online for VR Drums Ultimate Streamer to see full drum cover examples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technical Information</strong><br>Will VR Drums Ultimate Streamer work with my VR headset?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support OpenXR and has been tested on multiple PC's and different devices. Please see below for devices that are compatible with XR. Join Discord for other player videos or help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/85f80dd93344ca0a61a1c1a7c4cdccdd.avif?t=1786722564\" width=750 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔🟢Oculus -- Compatible </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔🟢Meta Quest -- Steam with Meta Quest Link</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔🟢Vive -- Compatible </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔🟢Valve Index -- Compatible </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔🟢Pico -- SteamVR OpenXR -- In Testing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIDI: If you don't have MIDI hardware or support on your PC, you won't physical MIDI hardware. You can setup virtual MIDI ports and devices with free software found in the VRDUS help guide that work directly with communicating with VR Drums Ult. Only a VR ready PC is needed. Updated PC/CPU, GPU RTX+, DD2/DD3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜***Game Manual is listed on the sidebar, click &quot;<strong>Visit the website</strong>&quot; link and help.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Practice Anytime</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic virtual reality drum set builder and simulator with thousands of dollars of real simulator drum hardware. Practice and play at your own pace, freestyle or cover your favorite song, just like a real drum set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Note Highways</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included in-game both 2D / 3D style note highways with scoring, combos and accuracy readings. Supports .mid, .chart and even raw audio midi files. Also the advanced 32 lane midi audio player note highway that will auto chart the drums in your new and old midi audio files so you can play along to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Connectivity</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the VR drum set to control Clone Hero, YARG, Fortnite Festival, REAPER DAW and more. MIDI Router included in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included 2D note highway example.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im