 cover examples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technical Information</strong><br>Will VR Drums Ultimate Streamer work with my VR headset?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support OpenXR and has been tested on multiple PC's and different devices. Please see below for devices that are compatible with XR. Join Discord for other player videos or help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/extras/85f80dd93344ca0a61a1c1a7c4cdccdd.avif?t=1786722564\" width=750 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔🟢Oculus -- Compatible </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔🟢Meta Quest -- Steam with Meta Quest Link</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔🟢Vive -- Compatible </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔🟢Valve Index -- Compatible </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔🟢Pico -- SteamVR OpenXR -- In Testing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIDI: If you don't have MIDI hardware or support on your PC, you won't physical MIDI hardware. You can setup virtual MIDI ports and devices with free software found in the VRDUS help guide that work directly with communicating with VR Drums Ult. Only a VR ready PC is needed. Updated PC/CPU, GPU RTX+, DD2/DD3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜***Game Manual is listed on the sidebar, click &quot;<strong>Visit the website</strong>&quot; link and help.</p>", "short_description": "Virtual drum simulator. Customizable. Sound included. MIDI notes out to control Clone Hero, YARG, Fortnite Festival, REAPER. In-game note highways included 2D/3D play your custom songs (.mid / .chart) Save custom kits. Foot pedal options in-game or external hardware.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354400/ce6f6d6c567cc0f8